```catala
declaration <add>
  content integer
  depends on x content integer, y content integer
  equals
    x + y


declaration scope T:
  output x content integer
  output y content integer

scope T:
  definition x equals 5 <add> 10
  definition y equals 6 <add> 3
  assertion (x = 15)
  assertion (y = 9)
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope T
┌─[RESULT]─ T ─
│ x = 15
│ y = 9
└─
```
